abstract: >-
  Long-horizon research corpus on rigorous routes to the
  Bohigas-Giannoni-Schmit conjecture for arithmetic and nonlinear quantum
  maps, including proofs, exact reductions, formal finite kernels,
  reproducible verification, counterexamples, retractions, and a consolidated
  research manuscript. Microscopic fixed-strength BGS remains open.
keywords:
  - quantum chaos
  - Bohigas-Giannoni-Schmit conjecture
  - cat maps
  - random matrix theory
  - spectral statistics
  - Weyl quantization
  - arithmetic dynamics
